>>
endobj
459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (to challenge girls to think like an engineer, empowering them to achieve whatever they set their minds to. From building robots to rockets, CURIE-OSITY kits aim to fuel creativity and encourage hands-on exploration of engineering concepts, with different themes of toys each delivery.)
/Pg 14 0 R
