462 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The themes for the three kits sent out during the campaign are robotics, sustainable energy, and rockets! Each CURIE-OSITY kit consists of a DIY toy along with an instruction manual, basic building tools, and a QR code which can be scanned to unlock a special 15-30 minute video from Mark Rober which explains the toy through tutorials and goes in-depth with the mechanics that allow the toy to function. For example, the CURIE-OSITY kit focused on sustainable energy will direct users to a video about sustainable energy, including how wind turbines work, what it means for energy to be sustainable, and applications in the real world.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [23]
>>
