/ActualText (mailing list, which consists of all SWENext members, and through social media ads \(#BeThatEngineer Promotion\). WOMENgineering Webinars are free to join for any pre-college students, but there is a limit of 1000 people who can join each webinar.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [29]
>>
endobj
523 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (WOMENgineering Webinars are designed to help build self-confidence and resilience among pre-college students interested in engineering and technology degrees and provides multiple opportunities to network with peers, mentors, role models, and industry professionals. With so many different secondary education and career paths to choose from, it can be overwhelming to determine what path is best for you. Each webinar will center around a distinct theme centered around the journey into engineering, and will highlight a different domain of engineering to broaden participants' understanding about the plethora of pathways in engineering. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
524 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Some of the featured speakers from the panel of WOMENgineers include:)
