/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (As part of our #BeThatEngineer social media campaign, we're excited to introduce three holiday-themed challenges for the month of March! Participants will submit their entries to SWENext through a Google form with links to their posts. As an incentive for challenge participants, the top 10 submissions selected by SWENext committee will be invited to present their creations at a virtual SWENext symposium comprising collegiate mentors, industry professionals, and the SWENext national leadership committee! There, final judging will be held, and the top 3 contenders of each challenge will win a $1,000 ScholarsInStem scholarship - provided by SWENext.)
/E (As part of our #BeThatEngineer social media campaign, we're excited to introduce three holiday-themed challenges for the month of March! Participants will submit their entries to SWENext through a Google form with links to their posts. As an incentive for challenge participants, the top 10 submissions selected by SWENext committee will be invited to present their creations at a virtual SWENext symposium comprising collegiate mentors, industry professionals, and the SWENext national leadership committee! There, final judging will be held, and the top 3 contenders of each challenge will win a $1,000 ScholarsInStem scholarship - provided by SWENext.)
