616 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (The true value of the $20,668 investment lies in empowering future female engineers, expanding global presence, and fostering mentorship and support networks. CURIE-osity Kits engage SWENexters with the tangible aspect of engineering, inviting creativity and innovation. Big Sis Mentorship exposes SWENexters to the various engineering disciplines and the plethora of opportunities available to them. Social media promotion enhances outreach, and themed challenges offer incentives for innovation. In the long term,  this investment will drive positive change and increase the number of women pursuing  engineering, leading to a brighter, more inclusive future in STEM.)
/E (The true value of the $20,668 investment lies in empowering future female engineers, expanding global presence, and fostering mentorship and support networks. CURIE-osity Kits engage SWENexters with the tangible aspect of engineering, inviting creativity and innovation. Big Sis Mentorship exposes SWENexters to the various engineering disciplines and the plethora of opportunities available to them. Social media promotion enhances outreach, and themed challenges offer incentives for innovation. In the long term,  this investment will drive positive change and increase the number of women pursuing  engineering, leading to a brighter, more inclusive future in STEM.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [48]
>>
