/T (The key metrics for this objective are number of social media followers, hashtag performance to evaluate the effectiveness of #BeThatEngineer, and click-through rate for campaign content to assess how effectively the content is driving engagement. Our targets are 5,000 followers on Instagram and TikTok, 1,500 mentions and shares with the campaign hashtag, and a CTR of 3%, slightly above the industry average of 2.7%.)
